      "tag": "althing_law_assembly",
      "direction": "rise",
      "description": "The Althing (established 930) was one of the world's earliest parliamentary assemblies, meeting annually at Þingvellir to recite laws, settle disputes, and make collective decisions, creating a functional stateless society for 300+ years.",
