          "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Icelandic_Commonwealth"
        }
      ],
      "tag_prose": "sturlungaold_civil_war"
    },
    {
      "tag": "external_military_pressure",
      "layer": "military_security",
      "description": "Exhausted by civil war, Icelandic chieftains accepted Norwegian sovereignty in 1262–1264 under the Old Covenant; the Althing survived but as a Norwegian administrative court rather than a sovereign assembly, ending the Commonwealth's independence",
